    "directions": [
      "In a handi, add oil, once it’s hot, cinnamon stick, bay leaf, onions, ghee and saute it for a while.",
      "Add ginger garlic paste and saute for a minute.",
      "Add potatoes, salt to taste, tender coriander stems, black peppercorns and cook it until potatoes are half cooked.",
      "Add curd, cover it with the lid and let it cook for 10-12 minutes until cooked well.",
      "Finish it with sugar, prepared masala mixture and cook for 2-3 minutes on low flames.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish or bowl, garnish it with coriander sprig and crushed black peppercorns.",
      "Serve hot with paratha or roti.",
      "In a pan, add cumin seeds, fennel seeds, cloves, coriander seeds, black peppercorns, black cardamom, salt to taste and dry roast for 2-3 minutes until aromatic.",
      "Add dry fenugreek leaves and roast it for a minute.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind into fine powder.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add prepared masala, refined flour slurry, water, fresh coriander leaves and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
